{ We have a passed pawn, but where should the rook be placed? }
1. Re1 { [%cal Ge1a1] } 1... Ra8 { Bring your rook to a1. } { [%cal Ge1a1] } 2. Ra1 { Rooks are better behind passed pawns than in front of them because they don't obstruct and block the path of the pawn. } *


